# 701 - Quest Spells to Trainers

## Status
- Created: 2026-04-02
- Phase: 2
- Priority: Medium

## Current Behavior
- Many class abilities are learned through quests in vanilla WoW
- Our server has no quest NPCs, so these abilities are inaccessible
- Players miss core class abilities that define their playstyle

## Intended Behavior
- All abilities normally learned from quests are available at trainers instead
- Abilities appear at appropriate level requirements
- No quests required for core class functionality

