## Implementation Steps

1. Research each class's quest-learned abilities
   - Document quest name, level, and spell granted
   - Note any prerequisites or chains
   - Identify racial-specific quest spells

2. Add abilities to trainer templates
   - Find trainer template IDs for each class
   - Add entries to npc_trainer table
   - Set appropriate level requirements
   - Set reasonable gold costs

3. Handle special cases
   - Pet training (hunters)
   - Totems (shamans) - may need special handling
   - Form unlocks (druids)
   - Demon summons (warlocks)
   - Stance unlocks (warriors)

4. Test each class
   - Create character, level to 20
   - Verify all expected abilities available
   - Check no duplicate trainer entries

